00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:41.160 line:100%
He!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:51.960 line:100%
He!

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:53.600 line:100%
He!

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:00.960 line:100%
<i>He!</i>

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.000 line:20%
<i>He!</i>

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:10.439 line:100%
In 2002, my dad
had a stroke for the first time,

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:13.120 line:100%
and he fell into the rooftop shaft.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.760 line:100%
And then,

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:18.520 line:100%
he was heavily injured in an operation.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.320 line:100%
And later,

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.960 line:100%
the sudden passing of his apprentice
exacerbated his condition.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.680 line:100%
Two years ago, he went into retirement.

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.560 line:100%
Out of nowhere, he received
something left behind by his apprentice.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.800 line:100%
Perhaps it triggered something in him.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.640 line:100%
His condition acted up, and he fainted.

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.240 line:100%
In his mind, his apprentice never died.

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:41.000 line:100%
He merely went to Beijing
to teach for 12 years.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.520 line:100%
Whenever his apprentice appeared,

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.440 line:100%
he'd convince him to stay
to help him investigate cases.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.800 line:100%
It seems like his memory is stuck in 2002.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.560 line:100%
I waited for you for five years!

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:21.800 line:100%
Why didn't you save me?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.160 line:100%
Why?

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:25.360 line:100%
Come back.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.920 line:100%
I'm waiting for you. Come down.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.400 line:100%
Keep me company. You…

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:02.960 line:100%
Doctor.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:04.480 line:100%
Doctor!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.920 line:100%
He. You're awake.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:09.960 line:100%
Why am I here?

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.639 line:100%
You fell into the rooftop shaft yesterday.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:19.319 line:100%
Fortunately, no bone fractures.
Just some cuts.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.600 line:100%
Fortunately?

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:21.879 line:100%
Officer He,

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.880 line:100%
you fell because you had a stroke,
and you lost consciousness.

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.040 line:100%
I checked your medical records.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.840 line:100%
Your cholesterol, blood sugar,
and blood pressure levels

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.040 line:100%
are dangerously high.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.480 line:100%
Did you take medication regularly?

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.600 line:100%
Taking pills during all three of my meals?

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:34.920 line:100%
Who can live like that?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.920 line:100%
Listen.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.160 line:100%
Your condition is serious.
You have to take your medication.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:40.400 line:100%
Otherwise, this will happen again,

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.480 line:100%
-and it will be more serious.
-Okay.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:44.840 line:100%
There are no other huge issues,

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.680 line:100%
but you will stay here for a few days.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.960 line:100%
Thanks, Doctor.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.200 line:100%
Captain Feng just left.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:05.800 line:100%
He told me everything.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:10.520 line:100%
Are you intending
to take full responsibility?

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:14.640 line:100%
Did you tell Captain Feng
that you want to go to Beijing to teach?

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.240 line:100%
He.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:32.400 line:100%
I'd like to apologize to you.
It's my fault.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.880 line:100%
Whether it's the missing persons case
or the homicide,

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:39.400 line:100%
I shouldn't have brought
my emotions into the case.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.560 line:100%
Give me your hand.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.800 line:100%
-That hand.
-Why?

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:54.600 line:100%
Press this.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.880 line:100%
He, what are you doing?
What about your IV drip?

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.840 line:100%
Now is not the time to lie down.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:02.720 line:100%
Let's go. We have a case to crack.

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:06.960 line:100%
Come.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:14.520 line:100%
In the June 30th case,

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.320 line:100%
Song Qingsong is undeniably
the main suspect.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:21.000 line:100%
But he allegedly fled
to the US five years ago.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:23.640 line:100%
Immigrating is suspicious enough.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:26.000 line:100%
Back then, Song Qingsong
hired someone to commit a murder.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.920 line:100%
But he was acquitted
due to a lack of evidence.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.920 line:100%
We could only charge him with bribery.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.760 line:100%
Even then, it wasn't that serious.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.720 line:100%
He would get five years in jail at most.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.880 line:100%
And when he would be released,
he would still be the same old him.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:39.880 line:100%
The factory, the car,
and the property would still be his.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:41.480 line:100%
So why did he flee?

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.280 line:100%
I did investigate him.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.320 line:100%
Song Qingsong had dealings in both
legitimate and illegitimate channels.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.480 line:100%
He's definitely not a good person,

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:49.400 line:100%
but he's kind to his factory workers.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.160 line:100%
Those workers have worked
for him for more than a decade.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:54.800 line:100%
Oh. He also has a son
who was only three years old when he fled.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:07:00.160 line:100%
So there's probably another story
behind his hiring of the hitman.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.280 line:100%
The most effective way

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.520 line:100%
to investigate Song Qingsong
is through Wu Shanlong.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:07.440 line:100%
But after he took over the cement factory,
he accrued debts

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:08.920 line:100%
and is now in hiding.

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.680 line:100%
Turn right at the intersection in front.

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:13.960 line:100%
We're not returning to the station?

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:15.800 line:100%
Shouldn't we find Wu Shanlong?

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.720 line:100%
HONGYUN HUIHUANG CLUB

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.320 line:100%
Who are you?

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:42.120 line:100%
This is the dressing room.

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:47.720 line:100%
Are you new here?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.400 line:100%
I'm Wu. W-U.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.440 line:100%
Shanlong is my name.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:58.560 line:100%
I am the biggest shareholder of this club.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.720 line:100%
Qingsong Cement Factory. Ever heard of it?

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:02.080 line:100%
It's mine too.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.920 line:100%
Perhaps I could book all of you today,

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:10.640 line:100%
so that you can get some good rest.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.840 line:100%
Hi, Mei.

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.880 line:100%
-Hi, Mei.
-Hi, Mei.

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.520 line:100%
Hi.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.320 line:100%
Come out here.

00:08:38.359 --> 00:08:40.520 line:100%
Leeching off this place every day.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.800 line:100%
Do I owe you anything or what?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.800 line:100%
Did I hear that correctly?

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.080 line:100%
Do you even know who you're talking to?

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:54.840 line:100%
Wu Shanlong.

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:57.160 line:100%
From now on,

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:59.320 line:100%
I won't lend a single cent to you.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:05.080 line:100%
Zhao Hongmei. I see you've grown arrogant.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.560 line:100%
Without me,

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:08.720 line:100%
you would still have been the owner
of that small massage parlor.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.400 line:100%
Who gave you your first fortune?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.040 line:100%
It was me, Wu Shanlong. It was me.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.080 line:100%
Without me, this place would still
be called Dahuihuang.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.800 line:100%
You helped me?

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.480 line:100%
Do you even have the wits for it?

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:22.920 line:100%
Without me,

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.880 line:100%
Song Qingsong would still
be running the cement factory,

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:27.920 line:100%
-and you would still be his chauffeur.
-What did you say?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.960 line:100%
-I gave you your share of the money.
-Say that again.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.280 line:100%
I gave you your share of the money.
You are just incompetent.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.920 line:100%
The cement factory was a gold mine,
but you messed it up.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.280 line:100%
And now, you're leeching off me.

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:41.040 line:100%
I've treated you with enough generosity.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:43.120 line:100%
Am I the shareholder here or not?

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.040 line:100%
I can come and go whenever I want.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:47.760 line:100%
Of course. Come whenever you want.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.720 line:100%
But before you come,

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:53.480 line:100%
clean up the mess you made.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:55.000 line:100%
What mess?

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.800 line:100%
Tell me. What mess?

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.440 line:100%
Still playing dumb?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.840 line:100%
The police just released a statement.

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:03.760 line:100%
Xu Zhihong's body was found in Yuanlongli.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.400 line:100%
They are investigating it everywhere now.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.600 line:100%
You killed Xu Meng too.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.920 line:100%
You are now a murderer.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.720 line:100%
Why don't you learn
from your brother-in-law?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.640 line:100%
Just run away. Run.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.360 line:100%
When you're gone, everyone will be safe.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.800 line:100%
The girls under me?

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.440 line:100%
I can't guarantee
they are as loyal as I am.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.400 line:100%
If one of them gets drunk
and runs their mouth,

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.800 line:100%
I won't be able to stop them.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:32.600 line:100%
Sure.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:35.760 line:100%
I can run away.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:37.920 line:100%
But I need you to give me some money.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.560 line:100%
Are you crazy?

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:51.800 line:100%
Zhao Hongmei.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.920 line:100%
You're talking to a murderer now.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:59.600 line:100%
How many lives do you risk by defying me?

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:06.480 line:100%
Defying you? What about that?

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.720 line:100%
What about that?
I won't comply, so kill me now.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:12.720 line:100%
Do you want to see
if I will go to the police right now?

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:14.240 line:100%
Please be patient, sir.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:15.920 line:100%
Our manager is having a meeting. You…

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:23.040 line:100%
What a coincidence.
My two old friends are here.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.960 line:100%
Great. Let's hang out.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:29.280 line:100%
Officer He. Officer Ran. You're here.

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:32.560 line:100%
I was just reminiscing
about the past with Mr. Wu here.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:33.720 line:100%
We talked about you two.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:36.680 line:100%
-Speak of the devil, really.
-Is that so?

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:38.840 line:100%
-Zhang!
-Yes?

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.720 line:100%
How is the speaker outside going?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.120 line:100%
-It's almost done, Mei.
-Show me.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.160 line:100%
I have work to do. Mr. Hu,

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:48.720 line:100%
entertain our old friends here, will you?

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:49.840 line:100%
I'll count on you. Take a seat.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:51.600 line:100%
Order anything you want. Take a seat.

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.600 line:100%
Take a seat.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:54.640 line:100%
Officer Ran!

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.640 line:100%
You're more handsome than before.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:11.800 line:100%
Speak.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.160 line:100%
Tell us about Xu Meng and her father.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.520 line:100%
What are you on about, Officer He?

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.280 line:100%
I don't know them.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.440 line:100%
Wu Shanlong,

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:27.080 line:100%
between us, there's no need to play coy.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:34.160 line:100%
Back then, Song Qingsong hired a hitman
to kill Xu Meng and her father.

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:36.040 line:100%
You did it, didn't you?

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.280 line:100%
How did Xu Zhihong die?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:45.080 line:100%
Where is Xu Meng? Is she dead or alive?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.200 line:100%
Speak!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.760 line:100%
I'll speak. Officer He,
I'll tell you everything.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:12:59.920 line:100%
I'll come clean.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.200 line:100%
I'll tell you everything.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:04.760 line:100%
Song Qingsong gave me 40,000 yuan

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.440 line:100%
to get rid of Xu Meng and her father.

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.440 line:100%
He doesn't care about laws, but I do.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.240 line:100%
I paid you to get rid of them,

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.360 line:100%
and what did you do?

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:13.720 line:100%
I asked you to do it yourself,

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.200 line:100%
but you paid someone else
to do it instead.

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:17.600 line:100%
That deal could have cost me my life.

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:20.520 line:100%
I wouldn't have done it,
even if he had punched me to death.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:21.720 line:100%
What about Wolfie?

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.360 line:100%
You know him very well, don't you?

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.480 line:100%
Get rid of them.

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:35.800 line:100%
What? What wolf?

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:37.800 line:100%
I don't know him.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:39.400 line:100%
Sure.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.440 line:100%
You said it had nothing to do with you.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:42.800 line:100%
Then tell me.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.640 line:100%
How did Xu Zhihong die?

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:51.080 line:100%
Based on my understanding
of Song Qingsong,

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.080 line:100%
he must have hired someone else to do it.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:55.400 line:100%
Achieve his goals at all costs.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.680 line:100%
That's his personality.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:59.920 line:100%
Why must Song Qingsong
get rid of Xu Meng and her father?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.240 line:100%
I know why.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:02.720 line:100%
Back then, Xu Meng

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.640 line:100%
saw the tender document
inside Song Qingsong's briefcase

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:05.640 line:100%
in the foot massage parlor.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.400 line:100%
Then, she wrote to Song Qingsong
to extort money.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.080 line:100%
Song Qingsong was furious

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.720 line:100%
and wanted her gone.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.840 line:100%
Getting rid of her father
was just an afterthought.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.720 line:100%
Why didn't you tell us back then?

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:18.880 line:100%
Because he was my brother-in-law.

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.360 line:100%
But now, it's different.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.480 line:100%
Just ask me whatever you want to know.

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:24.240 line:100%
I'll tell you everything I know.

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:37.280 line:100%
Wu Shanlong.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:41.120 line:100%
Have you contacted
Song Qingsong in recent years?

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.640 line:100%
We lost contact five years ago.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:48.560 line:100%
I don't know where he's hiding now.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:52.760 line:100%
Sir,

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.080 line:100%
if he contacts me,

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:59.640 line:100%
I promise to contact
the police right away.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:46.160 line:100%
Wu Shanlong. Do not leave Weiyang.

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:47.680 line:100%
We will talk to you anytime.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.560 line:100%
Sure, sir. I won't leave.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.520 line:100%
Drop by when you're free.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.720 line:100%
HONGYUN HUIHUANG CLUB

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:23.960 line:100%
That liar.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:25.960 line:100%
Not a word of truth from his mouth.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.920 line:100%
I made sure to ask him about Wolfie,

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.600 line:100%
and his eyes looked to the right.

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:33.200 line:100%
He knows that we don't have evidence,

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:34.760 line:100%
and we can't do anything about him.

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:40.240 line:100%
Now that the lead
on Song Qingsong is stuck,

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:43.040 line:100%
we can only find
another breakthrough in the scene.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:48.000 line:100%
He.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.520 line:100%
I want to go through
the suspicious residents

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:51.440 line:100%
in Yuanlongli again.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.200 line:100%
You still want to head to Yuanlongli?

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:56.600 line:100%
What if you're stuck in there?

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:02.960 line:100%
He.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:05.080 line:100%
Have you heard
of the Eye of the Vortex Theory?

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:06.639 line:100%
What?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:09.720 line:100%
The eye of the vortex
is the center of the vortex.

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.000 line:100%
To see it,

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:13.040 line:100%
you must venture into the vortex.

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:15.399 line:100%
New York Block
is at the center of the crime,

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:16.600 line:100%
the eye of the vortex.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.680 line:100%
Residents might come and go,

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.240 line:100%
but as long as the building's there,
we will find useful leads.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:29.840 line:100%
What?

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.760 line:100%
You almost had it there.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:33.640 line:100%
I thought you had lost your mind.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.120 line:100%
LIANG JUAN

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.560 line:100%
Yes, Officer Liang?

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:49.240 line:100%
Okay. Got it.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:50.720 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:52.800 line:100%
The Forensic Department
said they found toxins

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.160 line:100%
in Xu Zhihong's skull.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.880 line:100%
-What kind of toxin?
-They are analyzing it.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:59.840 line:100%
Let's do it this way.
We'll split up and search.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:01.200 line:100%
You'll head to Yuanlongli.

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.360 line:100%
I'll head to the station
to ask Liang for more information.

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:04.320 line:100%
Okay.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:07.960 line:100%
Oh.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:09.920 line:100%
If you're taking the same route,

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.760 line:100%
can you pick Xiaohe up for me at school?

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.760 line:100%
I've been busy lately.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:16.560 line:100%
I haven't seen her in a week.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.120 line:100%
Are you and your wife…

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.040 line:100%
Don't be nosy. Just do your work.

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:47.400 line:100%
I'LL PICK XIAOHE UP TODAY

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:48.600 line:100%
SEND MESSAGE

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:53.200 line:100%
DATE, TIME, VIEW OPTIONS

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:54.600 line:100%
RECIPIENT: YUN

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:55.960 line:100%
I BOUGHT FISH TODAY

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:58.320 line:100%
WILL YOU BE HOME FOR DINNER TODAY?

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.240 line:100%
DATE, TIME, VIEW OPTIONS

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.480 line:100%
RECIPIENT: YUN

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:03.000 line:100%
TOMORROW IS THE PARENT-TEACHER DAY

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.680 line:100%
WHO'S GOING? YOU OR ME?

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.720 line:100%
WEIYANG NO. 1 MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.600 line:100%
I like your palm.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:04.800 line:100%
Show me your right palm.

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:07.600 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:09.400 line:100%
Uncle Ran.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.600 line:100%
My uncle came to pick me up.
I have to go now. Bye!

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:15.680 line:100%
-Uncle Ran.
-Long time no see.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.640 line:100%
Are you here for a case?

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:20.240 line:100%
Your dad asked me to pick you up.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.000 line:100%
Oh.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.480 line:100%
He finally remembers he has a daughter.

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.720 line:100%
Come on. He has a business trip this week.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.560 line:100%
You have changed your style.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.600 line:100%
People change.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.480 line:100%
I was too childish.
It's not too late to grow up now.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.120 line:100%
Put your legs down. It's dangerous.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.960 line:100%
<i>Tomorrow, June 8th,</i>

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.640 line:100%
<i>our national team in Group C</i>

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:16.480 line:100%
<i>will face the strongest opponent</i>
<i>in the group,</i>

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.640 line:100%
<i>the Brazil team,</i>

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.680 line:100%
<i>who is highly anticipated</i>
<i>to win the World Cup.</i>

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:24.480 line:100%
<i>Let's hope that at 7:30 p.m. tomorrow,</i>
<i>our national team can create a miracle.</i>

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:25.800 line:100%
<i>There's only one way to find out.</i>

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:26.800 line:100%
<i>Passion</i>

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:30.680 line:100%
<i>Fighting for the glory of the team</i>

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:32.280 line:100%
<i>Come on, come on</i>

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:34.680 line:100%
<i>Power</i>

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:38.760 line:100%
<i>We will never bow under the sky</i>

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.680 line:100%
<i>Raise your hand</i>

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:42.360 line:100%
<i>Passion</i>

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:46.840 line:100%
<i>Fighting for the glory of the team</i>

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:48.680 line:100%
<i>Raise your hand</i>

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:50.120 line:100%
<i>Power</i>

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:02.080 line:100%
This is not the way back to my home.

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:04.320 line:100%
Are you trying to kidnap me?

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:06.840 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:08.520 line:100%
No one wants to kidnap

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:11.040 line:100%
a wild brat like you unless
there's something wrong with their brain.

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:21.160 line:100%
Why did you stop singing?

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:23.760 line:100%
Oh, no. It's Friday today.

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:26.040 line:100%
Uncle Ran, can you drive me
to the band's rehearsal?

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:27.880 line:100%
They are waiting for me.

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:31.720 line:100%
No. I promised He to take you home.

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:33.080 line:100%
After that, I have a case to investigate.

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:37.560 line:100%
Are you going to Yuanlongli?

00:22:40.240 --> 00:22:41.280 line:100%
It's on the way.

00:22:56.280 --> 00:22:59.040 line:100%
Liang. What did you find in his skull?

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:03.040 line:100%
We found excessive arsenic
in Xu Zhihong's skull.

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:06.000 line:100%
He was fed poison
for a long time before he died.

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:08.040 line:100%
It might be trisenox.

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.680 line:100%
Trisenox?

00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:11.880 line:100%
Arsenic, basically.

00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:13.640 line:100%
CONCLUSION: EXCESSIVE ARSENIC
FOUND IN THE VICTIM'S SKULL

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:31.280 line:100%
Xiaohe. Slow down. Wait for me.

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:33.360 line:100%
UNDERGROUND CAR PARK

00:23:37.800 --> 00:23:38.640 line:100%
Uncle Ran.

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:42.240 line:100%
Are you investigating the skull?

00:23:43.280 --> 00:23:44.400 line:100%
How did you know?

00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:46.680 line:100%
Everyone in the underground scene knows.

00:23:46.760 --> 00:23:48.920 line:100%
I knew you were involved in this case.

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:52.120 line:100%
You guys rehearse down here?

00:23:52.840 --> 00:23:54.960 line:100%
Yes. What's so shocking about that?

00:23:55.040 --> 00:23:57.600 line:100%
Many Western bands began in the garage.

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:01.280 line:100%
What role do you play in your band?

00:24:02.240 --> 00:24:04.160 line:100%
Lead vocal and bassist.

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:06.160 line:100%
Oh.

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:08.080 line:100%
I also write songs. I just wrote one.

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:10.720 line:100%
Uncle Ran, quick.

00:24:11.960 --> 00:24:14.400 line:100%
The acoustics in this spot are good.
Our keyboardist found it.

00:24:15.320 --> 00:24:16.720 line:20%
Guys, I'm here.

00:24:16.800 --> 00:24:18.160 line:20%
DO NOT THROW ANYTHING INSIDE
DO NOT TRESPASS

00:24:36.200 --> 00:24:38.000 line:100%
Uncle Ran. Just investigate your case.

00:24:38.080 --> 00:24:39.000 line:100%
I'll head back once the rehearsal is over.

00:24:40.280 --> 00:24:42.000 line:100%
I'll pick you up after two hours.

00:24:45.280 --> 00:24:46.120 line:100%
Hi, Officer Ran.

00:24:46.720 --> 00:24:47.560 line:100%
You're…

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:49.480 line:100%
The keyboardist I told you about.

00:24:50.280 --> 00:24:52.720 line:100%
You don't recognize me? I live upstairs.

00:24:52.800 --> 00:24:55.160 line:100%
You chased after me back then.

00:24:57.240 --> 00:24:59.360 line:100%
Little boy, your wounds are…

00:24:59.440 --> 00:25:01.120 line:100%
I fell when he chased after me.

00:25:03.280 --> 00:25:04.440 line:100%
Oh, it's you.

00:25:05.200 --> 00:25:07.120 line:100%
He might look fragile,

00:25:07.200 --> 00:25:09.520 line:100%
but he can man up if need be.

00:25:09.600 --> 00:25:12.440 line:100%
He risked his life

00:25:12.520 --> 00:25:14.800 line:100%
and took these instruments
out of his dad's bar.

00:25:14.880 --> 00:25:16.520 line:100%
They call me the instrument sponsor.

00:25:17.960 --> 00:25:18.840 line:100%
GENERAL WARD

00:25:18.920 --> 00:25:19.760 line:20%
Ms. Wang.

00:25:20.760 --> 00:25:22.000 line:20%
Officer He.

00:25:22.080 --> 00:25:23.360 line:20%
Did Han Zi'ang say anything?

00:25:30.320 --> 00:25:31.880 line:100%
He woke up just now.

00:25:31.960 --> 00:25:35.360 line:100%
But no matter what the doctor or I said,

00:25:36.280 --> 00:25:38.120 line:100%
he wouldn't react to us.

00:25:38.200 --> 00:25:41.600 line:100%
The doctor said he had…

00:25:41.680 --> 00:25:42.920 line:100%
Post-traumatic stress disorder?

00:25:43.520 --> 00:25:44.680 line:100%
Yes.

00:25:45.360 --> 00:25:47.680 line:100%
Madam Wang. Calm down now.

00:25:47.760 --> 00:25:50.000 line:100%
Han Zi'ang encountered a traumatic event.

00:25:50.080 --> 00:25:51.960 line:100%
His mind and his body
need time to recover.

00:25:53.000 --> 00:25:54.960 line:100%
We're running out of time, Officer He.

00:25:55.040 --> 00:25:56.920 line:100%
The school called me.

00:25:57.000 --> 00:25:59.640 line:100%
They will release
his expulsion notice tomorrow.

00:26:00.240 --> 00:26:01.920 line:100%
-Officer He. I'm begging you.
-Please.

00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:04.320 line:100%
Get up now. I'll call the principal now.

00:26:15.320 --> 00:26:17.880 line:100%
<i>Yesterday, several parents</i>
<i>escalated the issue to the board meeting.</i>

00:26:17.960 --> 00:26:19.880 line:100%
<i>The school is under immense pressure.</i>

00:26:19.960 --> 00:26:22.560 line:100%
<i>Besides, the police didn't make</i>
<i>any meaningful progress.</i>

00:26:22.640 --> 00:26:24.960 line:100%
Principal Qin, I understand
the difficulty of your position.

00:26:25.040 --> 00:26:25.960 line:100%
Han Zi'ang just woke up now.

00:26:26.640 --> 00:26:28.160 line:100%
I will uncover the truth
as soon as possible.

00:26:28.240 --> 00:26:30.480 line:100%
Then, the criminal department
will release a statement.

00:26:31.080 --> 00:26:32.760 line:100%
<i>Officer He, can you give me a deadline?</i>

00:26:32.840 --> 00:26:33.720 line:100%
<i>Not too long.</i>

00:26:33.800 --> 00:26:36.240 line:100%
<i>I need to justify myself</i>
<i>before the board and the parents.</i>

00:26:36.760 --> 00:26:38.600 line:100%
Seven days. Just seven days.

00:27:00.680 --> 00:27:02.240 line:100%
Mister. Hello.

00:27:02.320 --> 00:27:03.760 line:100%
Have you seen the child in this photo?

00:27:03.840 --> 00:27:05.040 line:100%
No.

00:27:06.920 --> 00:27:07.840 line:100%
Hi, mister.

00:27:07.920 --> 00:27:09.560 line:100%
Have you seen the child in this photo?

00:27:09.640 --> 00:27:10.560 line:100%
Not at all.

00:27:10.640 --> 00:27:11.800 line:100%
Hi.

00:27:11.880 --> 00:27:13.440 line:100%
Have you seen this child?

00:27:13.520 --> 00:27:14.360 line:100%
No.

00:27:14.440 --> 00:27:16.400 line:100%
Hi. Have you seen this child?

00:27:16.480 --> 00:27:17.320 line:100%
No.

00:27:22.400 --> 00:27:23.560 line:100%
Mr. He.

00:27:28.120 --> 00:27:29.240 line:100%
Qiao.

00:27:29.320 --> 00:27:30.240 line:100%
What are you doing here?

00:27:30.920 --> 00:27:32.200 line:100%
I'm here to see a doctor.

00:27:32.280 --> 00:27:34.440 line:100%
How do you feel now?

00:27:37.600 --> 00:27:39.800 line:100%
You introduced the doctor to Xiaohe?

00:27:39.880 --> 00:27:41.880 line:100%
She could've told me earlier.

00:27:44.600 --> 00:27:45.840 line:100%
Wait.

00:27:45.920 --> 00:27:48.640 line:100%
You're still so young.
What are you doing here?

00:27:48.720 --> 00:27:50.960 line:100%
I'm working for the Redevelopment Bureau,

00:27:51.040 --> 00:27:53.240 line:100%
and I have to talk to residents
who refuse to move.

00:27:53.320 --> 00:27:54.840 line:100%
It's stressful.

00:27:54.920 --> 00:27:56.280 line:100%
I have no one to talk to,

00:27:56.360 --> 00:27:58.720 line:100%
so I come here to talk to my therapist.

00:27:58.800 --> 00:28:03.000 line:100%
Have you not found a partner
after all these years?

00:28:04.560 --> 00:28:05.720 line:100%
I'm not in a rush.

00:28:07.200 --> 00:28:09.200 line:100%
Having a partner is nice,

00:28:09.280 --> 00:28:12.040 line:100%
but I can't find anyone as sweet

00:28:14.080 --> 00:28:16.040 line:100%
as Ran anymore.

00:28:19.360 --> 00:28:20.200 line:100%
Qiao.

00:28:21.760 --> 00:28:24.160 line:100%
We can't just live in the past.

00:28:25.200 --> 00:28:26.840 line:100%
We have to move on.

00:28:37.640 --> 00:28:39.960 line:20%
Officer Ran. Sorry for the long wait.

00:28:40.920 --> 00:28:41.960 line:100%
I have the name list

00:28:42.040 --> 00:28:43.600 line:100%
of all residents who lived
in New York Block in 1997.

00:28:43.680 --> 00:28:45.280 line:100%
-Take a look.
-Thank you so much, Ma Qiang.

00:28:45.360 --> 00:28:48.040 line:100%
Don't mention it.
Let me know if you need help.

00:28:51.960 --> 00:28:53.600 line:100%
1997 YUANLONGLI HOUSEOWNERS
TENANTS REGISTRATION FORM

00:29:13.080 --> 00:29:14.120 line:100%
Officer Ran.

00:29:39.400 --> 00:29:40.760 line:100%
After I entered through the gate,

00:29:40.840 --> 00:29:43.360 line:100%
I saw a familiar silhouette
and thought it was you.

00:29:43.440 --> 00:29:44.440 line:100%
Turns out I am right.

00:29:46.760 --> 00:29:47.720 line:100%
It's been so long.

00:29:48.640 --> 00:29:50.320 line:100%
How have you been?

00:29:50.840 --> 00:29:52.040 line:100%
Yes.

00:29:52.120 --> 00:29:55.360 line:100%
All of us have been busy in recent years.

00:29:55.440 --> 00:29:57.720 line:100%
I enrolled in the adult classes
of Weiyang University,

00:29:57.800 --> 00:29:59.120 line:100%
and I graduated last year.

00:30:00.520 --> 00:30:02.680 line:100%
What are you working as right now?

00:30:02.760 --> 00:30:05.880 line:100%
I am now interning
in an insurance company.

00:30:10.120 --> 00:30:12.080 line:100%
You encouraged me

00:30:12.160 --> 00:30:14.760 line:100%
to be more confident
and to make more friends.

00:30:15.880 --> 00:30:17.880 line:100%
And I did make more friends

00:30:17.960 --> 00:30:20.280 line:100%
and met my neighbors.

00:30:20.360 --> 00:30:23.720 line:100%
The rumors about me have stopped.

00:30:27.040 --> 00:30:28.160 line:100%
That's great.

00:30:30.280 --> 00:30:31.120 line:100%
Thank you.

00:30:34.560 --> 00:30:36.040 line:100%
You… You're injured.

00:30:36.760 --> 00:30:37.960 line:100%
You didn't even treat your injuries.

00:30:39.080 --> 00:30:40.360 line:100%
Just some cuts. It's nothing.

00:30:40.440 --> 00:30:41.480 line:100%
That's no good.

00:30:51.920 --> 00:30:53.320 line:20%
CASUAL SNEAKERS

00:30:54.160 --> 00:30:56.000 line:100%
You're being reckless.

00:30:56.080 --> 00:30:57.880 line:100%
Wounds are no joking matter.

00:31:08.160 --> 00:31:09.000 line:100%
Come.

00:31:52.760 --> 00:31:53.680 line:100%
Do you remember?

00:31:53.760 --> 00:31:55.600 line:100%
When we first met,

00:31:55.680 --> 00:31:57.880 line:100%
it was you who treated my wounds.

00:31:58.480 --> 00:31:59.320 line:100%
Yes.

00:32:00.480 --> 00:32:02.320 line:100%
I was quite clumsy back then.

00:32:02.400 --> 00:32:04.640 line:100%
Unlike you.

00:32:06.800 --> 00:32:08.080 line:100%
Actually,

00:32:08.160 --> 00:32:11.080 line:100%
my first job was a carer.

00:32:11.800 --> 00:32:13.240 line:100%
I worked in this apartment.

00:32:13.320 --> 00:32:15.200 line:100%
Ma Qiang told me before.

00:32:15.280 --> 00:32:18.560 line:100%
You cared for an old man.

00:32:20.720 --> 00:32:21.560 line:100%
Yes.

00:32:24.760 --> 00:32:25.920 line:100%
Oh.

00:32:26.680 --> 00:32:30.600 line:100%
Why did you come to Weiyang
from Guangxi? For work?

00:32:32.680 --> 00:32:36.560 line:100%
When I was little, my parents split up.

00:32:37.280 --> 00:32:39.240 line:100%
My dad moved abroad with my sister,

00:32:39.320 --> 00:32:42.520 line:100%
and I lived with my mom in Guangxi.

00:32:42.600 --> 00:32:45.680 line:100%
But after a few years,

00:32:47.240 --> 00:32:51.080 line:100%
my mom passed away due to an illness.

00:32:53.520 --> 00:32:56.640 line:100%
I had learned some nursing skills
in my night school,

00:32:57.240 --> 00:32:59.880 line:100%
so I asked my relatives to get me a job.

00:32:59.960 --> 00:33:01.720 line:100%
That was how I came to Yuanlongli.

00:33:02.320 --> 00:33:05.360 line:100%
When the old man
passed away due to an accident,

00:33:05.960 --> 00:33:07.640 line:100%
I had nowhere else to go.

00:33:07.720 --> 00:33:09.600 line:100%
So, I continued to rent this place.

00:33:13.440 --> 00:33:16.280 line:100%
It must have been tough on you
surviving on your own.

00:33:17.440 --> 00:33:19.880 line:100%
But no need to carry everything
on your shoulders.

00:33:19.960 --> 00:33:21.320 line:100%
If you need help,

00:33:22.760 --> 00:33:24.240 line:100%
just come to me.

00:33:26.480 --> 00:33:27.760 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:33:27.840 --> 00:33:30.040 line:100%
The toughest part has already passed.

00:33:31.240 --> 00:33:33.080 line:100%
I'm seeing the silver lining now.

00:33:37.600 --> 00:33:38.880 line:100%
But…

00:33:42.240 --> 00:33:43.160 line:100%
Yes?

00:33:43.240 --> 00:33:45.800 line:20%
DAJIANCHANG NEIGHBORHOOD

00:35:44.000 --> 00:35:45.960 line:100%
After the incident on the rooftop,

00:35:46.040 --> 00:35:49.560 line:100%
I always feel that someone
is staring at me at midnight.

00:35:50.160 --> 00:35:51.520 line:100%
It's creepy.

00:36:08.520 --> 00:36:10.480 line:100%
Qiao. If you run into trouble,

00:36:10.560 --> 00:36:11.760 line:100%
just call me.

00:36:14.920 --> 00:36:16.600 line:100%
Thank you, Officer Ran.

00:36:16.680 --> 00:36:17.920 line:100%
You're welcome.

00:36:20.640 --> 00:36:21.680 line:100%
Give me a moment.

00:36:23.280 --> 00:36:24.320 line:100%
Qing.

00:36:29.280 --> 00:36:31.720 line:100%
Qing. A thief broke in again.

00:36:31.800 --> 00:36:32.760 line:100%
What about your place?

00:36:32.840 --> 00:36:35.280 line:100%
-Exactly. Did you lose anything?
-That guy again?

00:36:35.360 --> 00:36:36.640 line:100%
Yes.

00:36:37.800 --> 00:36:39.200 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:36:42.520 --> 00:36:44.360 line:100%
Oh, your hidden boyfriend.

00:36:44.440 --> 00:36:45.880 line:100%
Why didn't you tell us?

00:36:45.960 --> 00:36:47.600 line:100%
No. Don't say that.

00:36:47.680 --> 00:36:50.920 line:100%
This is Ran Fangxu. Officer Ran.
He's here to investigate.

00:36:52.120 --> 00:36:55.120 line:100%
Mr. Officer, there's a pervert
in this building.

00:36:55.760 --> 00:36:56.680 line:100%
We live in Unit 1713.

00:36:56.760 --> 00:36:58.440 line:100%
Our clothes that we hung to dry

00:36:58.520 --> 00:37:00.280 line:100%
and our shoes were all stolen by a thief.

00:37:00.360 --> 00:37:02.920 line:100%
I reported it to the management,
but Qian Dajun doesn't care at all.

00:37:03.000 --> 00:37:05.400 line:100%
Also, that pervert also stole lingerie.

00:37:05.480 --> 00:37:07.040 line:100%
-Disgusting!
-That's right.

00:37:07.120 --> 00:37:09.080 line:100%
Mr. Officer, you must intervene.

00:37:10.320 --> 00:37:12.320 line:100%
Don't worry.
I'll investigate this properly.

00:37:12.400 --> 00:37:14.120 line:100%
No need to investigate.

00:37:14.200 --> 00:37:16.720 line:100%
We all know who the pervert is.

00:37:16.800 --> 00:37:18.040 line:100%
-Yes. We know.
-That's right.

00:37:41.520 --> 00:37:42.440 line:100%
Speak.

00:37:43.040 --> 00:37:44.520 line:100%
Why do you stare at the unit
belonging to the Xus?

00:37:45.160 --> 00:37:47.320 line:100%
I… No, I didn't do that.

00:37:47.400 --> 00:37:48.560 line:100%
I didn't do that.

00:37:48.640 --> 00:37:49.680 line:100%
You didn't?

00:37:50.440 --> 00:37:51.800 line:100%
Let's speak at the police station then.

00:37:51.880 --> 00:37:52.720 line:100%
Come.

00:37:54.320 --> 00:37:55.920 line:100%
I'll come clean.

00:37:56.000 --> 00:37:57.840 line:100%
I did do it.

00:38:03.280 --> 00:38:06.920 line:100%
Someone paid me to do it.

00:38:07.000 --> 00:38:09.480 line:100%
In the summer of 1996,

00:38:09.560 --> 00:38:13.600 line:100%
someone paid me 500 yuan
to spy on the unit opposite.

00:38:13.680 --> 00:38:16.160 line:100%
He told me to call him

00:38:16.240 --> 00:38:18.360 line:100%
if I found anything unusual.

00:38:18.440 --> 00:38:20.960 line:100%
You've been spying on them
for six years just for 500 yuan?

00:38:22.160 --> 00:38:24.920 line:100%
A work accident left me handicapped.

00:38:25.000 --> 00:38:26.360 line:100%
And I'm divorced.

00:38:26.440 --> 00:38:29.520 line:100%
I live all alone in this apartment.

00:38:29.600 --> 00:38:31.880 line:100%
I need something to entertain myself.

00:38:31.960 --> 00:38:33.120 line:100%
Speak.

00:38:34.320 --> 00:38:35.480 line:100%
Who hired you?

00:38:35.560 --> 00:38:37.560 line:100%
What's his name? What does he look like?

00:38:38.320 --> 00:38:39.200 line:100%
It was a man.

00:38:39.280 --> 00:38:41.720 line:100%
I don't know his name.

00:38:41.800 --> 00:38:44.240 line:100%
He looked like he was around 25 years old.

00:38:44.320 --> 00:38:46.760 line:100%
He was tall and bespectacled.

00:38:46.840 --> 00:38:49.560 line:100%
He had a 30/70 side part,
and he looked like a gentleman.

00:39:31.760 --> 00:39:33.480 line:100%
What a jerk.

00:39:33.560 --> 00:39:35.880 line:100%
I won't forgive you.